{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"遅くなりましたが、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂46　14枚目シングルの選抜発表がありましたね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回も選抜に選んで頂けました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大好きな犬組とまた3列目で活動できます嬉しいですヽ(・∀・)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みおなも一緒ヽ(・∀・)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もっと凄い3列目になるでしょう(＾ω＾)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まいまいのセンターのシングルです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まいまいっヽ(・∀・)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"リラックスして楽しい期間にしようね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2016/02/05/4043236/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今まで以上の最高の記念シングルになると思いますし、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"春の一歩前に踏み出す勇気"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"新しい出会いとの触れ合い方など"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いろんな方の応援になるシングルになるのかなぁヽ(・∀・)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まだ全然どんな風になるのか知りませんがね笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さん楽しみにしていて下さいね(＾ω＾)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"グループアイドルですし、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"福神、選抜、アンダーと分かれていますから"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"前に行かなければ行けませんよね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私を応援して下さってる皆さんがまた前にって応援して下さって凄くありがたい気持ちでいっぱいです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも今の私は前には行けません。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"気持ちも技術も前にいるには相応しくないと思うからです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今のこのポジションは毎日毎日私にいろんな事を教えてくれます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"新しいお仕事もこのポジションが経験させてくれました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だから今、凄く燃えています。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"長所も未熟な所も嫌ってほど良く見えます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だからといって"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"このポジションに相応しいかはわかりません。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ですが、とってもやり甲斐を感じます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この気持ちを楽しさに変えて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さんが私を応援している時や、乃木坂のライブの時に凄く楽しいっ嬉しいって思って頂ける様に頑張ります！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2016/02/05/4043236/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今までの私もですが、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつまでもデビュー当時の私ではいられません。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これからの私を作れたらいいなと思っています！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"14枚目"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"何気"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph",